.Dd August 3, 2026
.Dt UNMOUNT.SH 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm unmount.sh
.Nd late filesystem unmount for microinit shutdown
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Shell script executed by
.Xr microinit 8
in
.Cm init
mode at the end of ordered shutdown, after all supervised services have stopped and
before
.Xr reboot 2
/
.Xr poweroff .
.Cm supervise
mode never runs this script.
Not hardcoded in Rust so unmount policy can change without recompilation.
.Pp
Search order:
.Bl -enum
.It
.Pa /data/etc/microinit/unmount.sh
.Pq if present ; under
.Ev DATA_DIR
when set
.It
.Pa /etc/microinit/unmount.sh
.It
Portable script embedded in the
.Nm microinit
binary
.Pq Pa scripts/unmount.sh
.El
.Ss Responsibilities
The portable embedded script:
.Bl -enum
.It
.Ic sync
.It
Attempt
.Ic umount -a -r
excluding essential pseudo-filesystems
.Pq proc, sysfs, devtmpfs, devpts, tmpfs
.It
.Ic sync
again
.El
.Pp
Product images may install
.Pa /etc/microinit/unmount.sh
with a distro-specific script
.Pq for example BigFred OS unbinds Pa /etc/shadow and umounts Pa /data
or an override under the data root; otherwise the embedded portable script runs.
.Ss Environment
.Bl -tag -width MICROINIT_INIT_LOGS_TTY
.It Ev DATA_DIR
Persistent data root
.Pq absolute path ; default Pa /data
.It Ev MICROINIT_LOGS_TTY
Service logs TTY path from
.Nm microinit Cm init
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty2
.It Ev MICROINIT_INIT_LOGS_TTY
microinit operational logs TTY
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty3
.It Ev MICROINIT_CONSOLE
Console TTY path
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty1
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
Non-zero is logged by
.Nm microinit
but does
.Em not
block reboot or power-off.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr microinit 8 ,
.Xr early-boot.sh 8 ,
.Xr umount 8
